{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call-1318aa6b-4a0f-4c88-8d7f-8ce11cebdfb8","type":"tool_result","content":"# Memory Index\n\n- [wrapDatabaseOperation god node](project_wrap_database_operation.md) — sanitizes DB errors before prod logs; ubiquity is intentional, always wrap new repo methods\n- [Use Playwright for tests](feedback-use-playwright-for-tests.md) — Playwright is the chosen runner, including unit-level logic; no vitest/jest\n- [No proactive tests](feedback-no-proactive-tests.md) — don't write tests during fix rounds unless asked; ship the fix\n- [AI event asks one at a time](feedback-ai-event-one-at-a-time.md) — create-event AI must ask ONE MCQ-chip question per turn, confirm inferred values, never batch\n- [Copilot grounded brief](project-copilot-grounded-brief.md) — dashboard copilot context is now a live EVENT BRIEF from the dashboard's own feed; smart-actions/forecast/payout are shared utils (single source of truth)\n- [Tool-neutral skills](project-tool-neutral-skills.md) — canonical skills in docs/skills/, AGENTS.md canonical, CLAUDE.md glue; user also uses commandcode AI; edit canonical files not wrappers\n- [Commit in parts](feedback-commit-in-parts.md) — standing preference: split work into several small per-concern commits, not one big commit per feature\n- [Minimize clarifying questions](feedback-minimize-clarifying-questions.md) — don't ask about execution mode/worktree/branch-finishing choices; pick sensible defaults and proceed\n- [Reuse existing, not new deps](feedback-reuse-existing-not-new-deps.md) — reuse in-repo components/libs (e.g. create-event DescriptionEditor) instead of `pnpm add`; grep first, confirm before adding a dep\n- [No skeleton flash on refetch](feedback-price-ui-no-skeleton-flash.md) — price/quote UI: skeleton only on true first load, dim-in-place on later refetches (stepper taps etc.)\n- [Walk-in booking UI consolidation](project-walkin-offgrid-booking-ui.md) — QR walk-in funnel collapsed 