{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01a1fa12b8647711b470c55e","type":"tool_result","content":"=== Seat model ===\n1643:model Seat {\n1644-  seatId String @id @default(uuid(7))\n1645-\n1646-  eventSeatMapId String\n1647-  eventSeatMap   EventSeatMap @relation(fields: [eventSeatMapId], references: [eventSeatMapId])\n1648-\n1649-  ticketTypeId String?\n1650-  ticketType   TicketType? @relation(fields: [ticketTypeId], references: [ticketTypeId])\n1651-\n1652-  rowLabel   String\n1653-  seatNumber String\n1654-  x          Float\n1655-  y          Float\n1656-  rotation   Float  @default(0)\n1657-\n1658-  status       SeatStatus @default(AVAILABLE)\n1659-  isAccessible Boolean    @default(false)\n1660-\n1661-  holdBookingId String?\n1662-  holdBooking   Booking?  @relation(fields: [holdBookingId], references: [bookingId], onDelete: SetNull)\n1663-  holdExpiresAt DateTime?\n1664-\n1665-  ticket Ticket?\n1666-\n1667-  createdAt DateTime @default(now())\n1668-  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt\n1669-\n1670-  @@unique([eventSeatMapId, rowLabel, seatNumber])\n1671-  @@index([eventSeatMapId, status])\n1672-  @@index([ticketTypeId])\n1673-  @@index([holdBookingId])\n1674-  @@index([holdExpiresAt])\n1675-}\n1676-\n1677-model AttendeeFieldResponse {\n1678-  responseId String      @id @default(uuid(7))\n1679-  ticketId   String\n1680-  ticket     Ticket      @relation(fields: [ticketId], references: [ticketId])\n1681-  fieldId    String\n1682-  field      CustomField @relation(fields: [fieldId], references: [fieldId])\n1683-  value      String\n=== seat status enum ===\n166:enum SeatStatus {\n167-  AVAILABLE\n168-  HELD\n169-  BOOKED\n170-  BLOCKED\n171-}\n172-\n173-enum EventCategory {\n174-  SPORTS","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call-7804811d-daa0-4a1c-876c-2bdfd4a643ad","agent_id":"a6f93236d4c734935","session_id":"8db18de0-e6fa-4cab-a756-dd1477016fa1","uuid":"fcf317ac-114e-4dd9-b970-da154533b6f2","timestamp":"2026-11-20T17:48:15.352Z